frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|{v}_{12}|+|{v}_{22}|=|-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}|+|\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}|=\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{5}}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385881 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385882 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385883 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385884 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385885 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186385883 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385880 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a3fc05ae-4f60-5971-aae9-bcab380baf50" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385881 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385881 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385881 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7298123d-e222-5ca3-9525-3902520c925c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385882 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{10}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385882 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385882 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a7e67d4a-7cab-5968-8a1e-93e5b46651cc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385883 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{5}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385883 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385883 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6a74b705-8324-5d7f-be04-e583cb227864" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385884 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385884 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385884 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "402cfa88-7311-577a-a24e-59b6ddd008d0"